{"title": "Do You Jump In", "type": "Trading mistake", "hooks": ["The price is flying and everyone's talking about it. Do you jump in?", "Chasing a flying price is how you buy the top.", "Stop chasing the spike. Wait for the pullback instead."], "scenes": [{"kind": "hook", "vo": "Stop chasing the spike. Wait for the pullback instead.", "text": "Do you jump in?", "chart": 0, "win": [20, 115], "show": 90}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 0, "head": "The run up", "vo": "Here, it ran from 12.91 to 13.90 in a few candles. That's when fear of missing out kicks in.", "cues": [{"say": "12.91", "do": "mark", "i": 73, "label": "A", "side": "low", "tone": "teal"}, {"say": "13.90", "do": "mark", "i": 85, "label": "B", "side": "high", "tone": "amber"}], "win": [20, 115], "show": 90}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 0, "head": "Chasing buys the top", "vo": "By the time everyone's talking about a move, much of it has often already happened. Chase here and you buy near the top.", "cues": [{"say": "buy near the top", "do": "shade", "from": 79, "to": 85, "tone": "red"}], "win": [20, 115], "show": 90}, {"kind": "question", "chart": 0, "badge": "Q1", "head": "Hold or break?", "vo": "Then it pulled back to support. Does the level hold, or break?", "win": [20, 115], "options": ["It holds: the price turns up from the support", "It breaks: the price closes through the support and keeps going"], "answer": 0, "show": 90, "cues": [{"say": "", "do": "options"}, {"say": "", "do": "line", "price": 13.61, "label": "Support", "tone": "level"}]}, {"kind": "answer", "chart": 0, "head": "It held", "vo": "It held. The price turned away from support. Waiting for the pullback gave a calmer entry, with a clear stop below the level.", "win": [20, 115], "reveal_to": 115, "carry": true, "cues": [{"say": "", "do": "mark", "i": 83, "label": "Sw", "side": "high"}]}, {"kind": "cards", "head": "When you miss a move", "vo": "Have a plan for missing a move. Wait for a pullback, or find the next setup. There's always another trade.", "items": [{"text": "Wait for a pullback", "sub": "let the price come back", "icon": "clock"}, {"text": "Find the next setup", "sub": "the market keeps making them", "icon": "chart"}, {"text": "Another trade comes", "sub": "missing one costs you nothing", "icon": "check"}], "cues": [{"say": "wait for a pullback", "do": "item", "i": 0}, {"say": "find the next setup", "do": "item", "i": 1}, {"say": "always another trade", "do": "item", "i": 2}], "chart": null}, {"kind": "outro", "text": "Practise staying calm", "vo": "Practise staying calm with practice money at memestreet.net.", "chart": null}], "caption": "The price is flying and everyone's talking about it. Do you jump in?\nThat's fear of missing out.\nBy the time everyone's talking about a move, much of it has often already happened.\nHave a plan for missing a move: wait for a pullback, or find the next setup.\nThere's always another trade. Save this for the next spike.\nPractise at memestreet.net\nFictional market. Not investment advice.\n#MemeStreet #FOMO #TradingPsychology #LearnToTrade", "charts": [{"candles": [[12.68, 12.69, 12.63, 12.64, 241119], [12.64, 12.67, 12.55, 12.56, 656717], [12.56, 12.64, 12.55, 12.62, 553532], [12.62, 12.63, 12.62, 12.62, 157549], [12.62, 12.66, 12.62, 12.65, 117743], [12.68, 12.69, 12.5, 12.54, 871928], [12.54, 12.59, 12.44, 12.44, 486303], [12.44, 12.53, 12.43, 12.47, 549922], [12.47, 12.48, 12.44, 12.46, 468889], [12.46, 12.46, 12.4, 12.44, 233942], [12.44, 12.44, 12.39, 12.39, 290912], [12.42, 12.7, 12.41, 12.67, 2295923], [12.67, 12.76, 12.62, 12.73, 885513], [12.74, 12.86, 12.74, 12.85, 739282], [12.85, 12.93, 12.84, 12.93, 467936], [12.93, 12.97, 12.92, 12.97, 106884], [12.97, 12.99, 12.94, 12.95, 300701], [12.94, 13.18, 12.94, 13.07, 1171536], [13.08, 13.14, 13.05, 13.12, 514470], [13.12, 13.15, 13.05, 13.08, 787372], [13.08, 13.19, 13.08, 13.18, 681285], [13.18, 13.21, 13.11, 13.11, 121791], [13.12, 13.12, 12.68, 12.69, 481389], [12.72, 13.32, 12.59, 13.08, 29994